     • r = 5 is INSUFFICIENT for stable variance component estimation.
     • r ≥ 20–30 is REQUIRED for stable REML estimation of σ²_rep.
     • Two-tier design: expensive variance estimation on subsample,
       cheap contrasts on full sample.
