I.15 Phase 7 Mechanistic Bridge — Edge-Conditional Patching

```
  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
  ║  EDGE-CONDITIONAL ACTIVATION PATCHING                                        ║
  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

     Step 1: Identify high-K edges from Phase 6
     ─────────────────────────────────────────

        (X_i, X_j)  with  K_ij  ≥  K_crit  (top 5% of edges)

                       │
                       ▼

     Step 2: Run forward pass on both prompts
     ────────────────────────────────────────

        X_i  ──▶  ┌─────────────────────────┐  ──▶  Y_i
                  │  Layer 1 ─ Layer 2 ─... │
                  │  (activations A_i^ℓ)    │
                  └─────────────────────────┘

        X_j  ──▶  ┌─────────────────────────┐  ──▶  Y_j
                  │  Layer 1 ─ Layer 2 ─... │
                  │  (activations A_j^ℓ)    │
                  └─────────────────────────┘

                       │
                       ▼

     Step 3: Patch A_i^ℓ ← A_j^ℓ at layer ℓ, head h
     ──────────────────────────────────────────────

        X_i  ──▶  ┌─────────────────────────┐  ──▶  Y_i^patch
                  │  Layer 1 ─ ... ─ Layer ℓ  │
                  │              ▲            │
                  │              │            │
                  │         A_j^ℓ (patch)     │
                  └─────────────────────────┘

                       │
                       ▼

     Step 4: Measure recovery
     ─────────────────────────

        Δ_recovery = D_Y(Y_i, Y_i^patch) / D_Y(Y_i, Y_j)

        • Δ_recovery ≈ 1  →  layer ℓ / head h carries the sensitivity
        • Δ_recovery ≈ 0  →  no causal effect at that location

     Novelty: only high-K edges are patched (not all edges).
     This is NOT global activation steering (already done by others).
```

